      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然与胜利失之交臂，但『橡树大赛』中的\n奔跑也绝非糟糕的表现。\n『秋华赏』的胜利，绝非遥不可及——",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6065c38b15a1e626a8baf7a099f154fd7d53a8d634c29ef736c21c3bddf8f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
